      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-22T09:13:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>See the FAQ at <a href=\"http://is.gd/sifaq\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://is.gd/sifaq</a>&nbsp;under 'Ravage' for pointers to some more discussion.</p><p>The simultaneous vs sequential distinction does make a difference if the damage to the land would destroy a Sacred Site from Vital Strength of Earth. I don't know of other examples yet.</p>",
