      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-22T16:17:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the clarification!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It is not really correct to say that the Invaders attack the land and then attack the Dahan.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is where we got into trouble, because that’s almost exactly how the rulebook phrased it! Attack the land, attack the Dahan. So we weren’t sure if we were putting a Sentinels “-1 damage dealt” token on the Invaders or if we were gaining a Tactics blocking die to reduce a single point of the total damage.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t know of other examples yet.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, it sure matters to the number of Dahan that survive.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:28:42.666Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
