      "raw": "Thanks for the clarification!\n\n[quote=\"Arcanist Lupus\"]\n\nIt is not really correct to say that the Invaders attack the land and then attack the Dahan.  \n\n[/quote]\n\nThis is where we got into trouble, because that's almost exactly how the rulebook phrased it! Attack the land, attack the Dahan. So we weren't sure if we were putting a Sentinels \"-1 damage dealt\" token on the Invaders or if we were gaining a Tactics blocking die to reduce a single point of the total damage.\n\n[quote=\"dpt\"]\nI don't know of other examples yet.\n[/quote]\n\nWell, it sure matters to the number of Dahan that survive.",
