      "created_at": "2017-07-22T19:29:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yup - Defend is phrased slightly ambiguously, and somewhere along the line the Ravage section lost the word \"simultaneously\", which combine to make it somewhat unclear how things work. I'm keeping <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the searchable FAQ</a> updated.</p>",
